## Why This Is Asked
Understanding vector clocks and the happens-before relation for debugging causality in distributed systems.

## Key Concepts
- Vector clocks
- Happens-before
- Concurrency detection in logs

## Code Example
```javascript
function compareVC(a, b) {
  let lessEq = true, greaterEq = true;
  for (let i = 0; i < a.length; i++) {
    if (a[i] > b[i]) lessEq = false;
    if (a[i] < b[i]) greaterEq = false;
  }
  if (lessEq && greaterEq) return 'equal';
  if (lessEq) return 'a_before_b';
  if (greaterEq) return 'b_before_a';
  return 'concurrent';
}
```

